<title>POLAND: Elektromontaz-W full 1996 group results.</title>
<headline>Elektromontaz-W full 1996 group results.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elektromontaz Warszawa SA preliminary group results for financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>							   1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit			 3.53</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit			   3.69</p>
<p>    Group net profit				 1.99</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Elektromontaz Warszawa SA. Earlier the company has not reported its group results.</p>
<p>    Group net sales				 54.42</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    Group costs of sales			  44.38</p>
<p>    Group extraordinary loss		     0.03</p>
<p>    Group income tax				 1.61</p>
<p>    Group financial revenues		     0.26</p>
<p>    Group financial costs			  0.08</p>
<p>    Group investment				 3.39</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
